# CIS-licensed consumer-side artifacts (#347 phase 2 / Path A).
# These files contain CIS Benchmark prose imported locally by each consumer
# from their own licensed copy of the CIS spreadsheet. Per the CIS SecureSuite
# membership agreement, this content cannot be redistributed publicly — even
# verbatim. The local files stay on the consumer's machine; CheckID itself
# never carries the prose. See LICENSES/CIS-CONSUMER-SIDE.md.
*.local.json
data/cis-m365-v6-authored.local.json
data/registry.local.json

